{"id":"cd60c4fd5153541e414f1a085c1ae3e5a0902495","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1246473","title":"codex 的梯子流量消耗很大，怎么治？","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"nl101531","excerpt":"OpenAI - @nl101531 - 梯子一个月 300G 不够用了，消耗太离谱。。。","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    <div><p>梯子一个月 300G 不够用了，消耗太离谱。。。</p></div>\n    \n    \n    \n    <div>\n        <p><span>Supplement 1 &#160;·&#160; <span title=\"2026-10-05 15:58:59 +08:00\">16h 12m ago</span></span></p>\n        \n        <p>先关闭遥测功能再跑跑，图片是一个点但不至于消耗这么多。</p>\n        \n    </div>\n    \n    \n</div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/流量\"><li></li> 流量</a><a href=\"/tag/消耗\"><li></li> 消耗</a><a href=\"/tag/梯子\"><li></li> 梯子</a></P><p><span>37 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-10-06 06:38:00 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18148746\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/dc46/0936/327769_normal.png?m=1696487536\" alt=\"edinina\" data-uid=\"327769\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/edinina\">edinina</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-05 11:18:18 +08:00\">20h 52m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>哈哈一样，带着上下文来来回回，对话里带点图片每次都几十 M</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18148762\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b6a1/2393/233073_normal.png?m=1572831959\" alt=\"heyjei\" data-uid=\"233073\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/heyjei\">heyjei</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-05 11:26:25 +08:00\">20h 44m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>codex 称为 bugx 一点也不为过。我的 codex 一直在不停的循环下载一个 300 多 M 的文件</p><p>你可以让 codex 自己去看下这个 300G 都是什么流量。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18148768\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/da7d/fb92/754606_normal.png?m=1789721027\" alt=\"mathiashu4\" data-uid=\"754606\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/mathiashu4\">mathiashu4</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>PRO</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-05 11:28:54 +08:00\">20h 42m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我觉得奶昔的策略配置的蛮好的。。我 200G 基础的用起来没有这么快</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18148770\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/2a79418a9fe22c4bfa277c80ae8e0a87?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"psllll\" data-uid=\"293837\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/psllll\">psllll</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-05 11:31:09 +08:00\">20h 40m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>买个大流量梯子，把图片文件啥的分流出去</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18148895\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/b92440c21069e2af1db5d45adbe228da?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"JoJoP\" data-uid=\"167033\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/JoJoP\">JoJoP</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-05 12:55:50 +08:00\">19h 15m ago via iPad</span> \n                    \n                    <p>handoff 然后新开会话<br>或者项目单独弄个图片目录 让他只读路径</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18148902\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/611333f620d4d1aee5e8e614e693f9e6?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"cookieleeljx\" data-uid=\"852810\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/cookieleeljx\">cookieleeljx</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-05 13:00:16 +08:00\">19h 10m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我用的是 tokenbox.cloud 里面的 codex 用着还行挺省的啊，为啥你消耗那么大</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18148920\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/05ba/0783/363963_normal.png?m=1715864297\" alt=\"shilianmlxg\" data-uid=\"363963\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/shilianmlxg\">shilianmlxg</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-05 13:11:48 +08:00\">18h 59m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>自己买个小鸡 zouter 有 1 2t 的那种 而且 jp 也能挂 cpa</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18148958\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/cb7e/d3ff/714531_normal.png?m=1761119463\" alt=\"V2Try\" data-uid=\"714531\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/V2Try\">V2Try</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-05 13:43:29 +08:00\">18h 27m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>开 codex 都搞得我 Macbook air 发热，不知道咋优化的，用 Claude 就不这样</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18148982\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a7ec/01fa/140617_normal.png?m=1686535872\" alt=\"CloudnuY\" data-uid=\"140617\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/CloudnuY\">CloudnuY</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-05 14:01:26 +08:00\">18h 9m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我们 20 多天用了 400G ，有天突然断了才发现流量超了……</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18148988\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4867/6f2b/172950_normal.png?m=1777123214\" alt=\"liuyin\" data-uid=\"172950\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/liuyin\">liuyin</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-05 14:09:20 +08:00\">18h 1m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我在 vscode 用 codex 插件也是，更新巨频繁，更新一次就要 1G 多，服了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18148990\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/721ac1354ab27a00d16947f5b8fc4e47?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"zed1018\" data-uid=\"315288\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/zed1018\">zed1018</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-05 14:10:08 +08:00\">18h 1m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>先看自己项目啥情况吧。之前我也以为是 codex ，后来才发现其实是 docker 镜像。因为 codex 用它来做集成测试。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18149178\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/3da6ab76d7f7da80952c2130728a2f19?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"undertheros3\" data-uid=\"637925\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>16</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/undertheros3\">undertheros3</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-05 16:40:49 +08:00\">15h 30m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我最近也发现了，昨天下午跑着任务我去睡觉了，一觉醒来梯子没流量了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18149208\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/8597/43c7/808002_normal.png?m=1789114171\" alt=\"shuijingwanwqyy\" data-uid=\"808002\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>18</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/shuijingwanwqyy\">shuijingwanwqyy</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-05 16:59:23 +08:00\">15h 11m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我自建梯子，一个月 Codex 只用了 100 多个 GB 流量了。可能是因为我将一些重任务通过 MCP ，直接让 ChatGPT 网页版本执行了的缘故。感觉 ChatGTP 网页版本执行的任务量是，3 倍于 Codex 了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18149345\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/3df0950cd0620c6854a398f2dff60b07?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"b2byco\" data-uid=\"213801\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>19</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/b2byco\">b2byco</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-05 18:57:14 +08:00\">13h 14m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>更新太频繁了吧 一次确实 1G 左右</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18149353\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0927/c846/520914_normal.png?m=1782456613\" alt=\"showonder\" data-uid=\"520914\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>20</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/showonder\">showonder</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-05 19:01:22 +08:00\">13h 9m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>图片多的我都不太用本地项目跑了，之前整理一个扫描的古籍图片，30 多张高清图反复上传，任务干完用了我 120GB 的流量</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18149470\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/c043/fd31/478037_normal.png?m=1788884292\" alt=\"humbass\" data-uid=\"478037\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>21</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/humbass\">humbass</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-05 20:46:05 +08:00\">11h 25m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>自己搭个🪜子，怎么都是 2T 起步</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18149637\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/8618aab7f4ed261cc87c1e4a590bdfb3?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"loveleyla2013\" data-uid=\"470394\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>23</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/loveleyla2013\">loveleyla2013</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-05 23:14:21 +08:00\">8h 56m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>1 放弃 codex ，用 Claude 2 自己搭梯子，我是 aws lightsail 东京</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18149642\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0e09/5e05/1183_normal.png?m=1708966496\" alt=\"ETiV\" data-uid=\"1183\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>26</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ETiV\">ETiV</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-05 23:25:02 +08:00\">8h 46m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>你可以自己抓包验证一下：<br>OpenAI 新的 Responses 格式非常的冗余…响应里会把请求的 body 再下发一次，非常的浪费流量、空间</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18149658\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/c043/fd31/478037_normal.png?m=1788884292\" alt=\"humbass\" data-uid=\"478037\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>28</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/humbass\">humbass</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-05 23:41:18 +08:00\">8h 29m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/liangrongze\">liangrongze</a> <br>一个是协议问题，目前最问题的是 reality \\ hy2<br>一个是机房问题，尽量不要买国内服务商的，AWS 就很好。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18149676\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3975/6000/662828_normal.png?m=1778314902\" alt=\"ktyang\" data-uid=\"662828\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>30</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ktyang\">ktyang</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-05 23:54:07 +08:00\">8h 17m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>不要小瞧图片，我之前开过帖子提醒过，图片对流量的消耗非常大，我之前有一晚上干掉了 200G 的经历，建议你统计一下。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18149693\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0b2f/c489/598051_normal.png?m=1786591349\" alt=\"CHTRCT\" data-uid=\"598051\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>33</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/CHTRCT\">CHTRCT</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-06 00:08:42 +08:00\">8h 2m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>codex 桌面版会频繁吃上行带宽</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    